# `public/` is now entirely Vite build output (sources live in src/, static/ and index.html)
public/

package-lock.json
yarn.lock
*swp
*swo

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client-derived assets. NEVER commit anything in these paths.
#
# They are generated from a local PlanetSide client install (see
# `npm run build-client-assets`) and contain material owned by Daybreak Game
# Company: item names and description prose from the client's string table, and
# inventory artwork from its texture archives. The generator is part of this
# repo; its output is not, and must not be redistributed here or in any image
# published from here. The app degrades to internal object names and plain grid
# tiles when these are absent, so a fresh clone still builds and runs.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# `data/*` rather than `data/`: git cannot re-include a file whose parent DIRECTORY is
# excluded, so the negation below only works against a contents glob.
data/*
# ...except the item table, which is committed. Its description prose -- the one clearly
# copyrightable part -- is stripped before commit; what remains is names, types and grid
# footprints, the factual identifiers the inventory UI needs to render anything at all.
!data/items-english.json
static/items/
